<title>USA: Medical Industries names Paul Pershes pres.</title>
<headline>Medical Industries names Paul Pershes pres.</headline>
<dateline>BOYNTON BEACH, Fla. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medical Industries of America Inc said Thursday that Paul Pershes was named president.</p>
<p>Michael Morrell will continue as chairman of the board and as chief executive officer, the company said.</p>
<p>Pershes has been a principle in the accounting firm of Weinberg, Pershes &amp; Co of Boca Raton, Fla.</p>
